    "body": "TODO: `path_nodes_shared_keys` is probably unsafe. I am investigating and trying to produce a conclusive test result in which I can show why it's unsafe.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n1. Shared key caching in `Onion_Node` within `onion_client.c`. Allows `client_send_announce_request` to reuse precomputed shared keys when communicating with onion nodes, avoiding expensive Curve25519 `encrypt_precompute` calls on every announce packet.\r\n2. Refactor `shared_key_cache_lookup` in `shared_key_cache.c` for better performance:\r\n    * Use a better hash (XOR of 4 bytes) for bucket distribution.\r\n    * Return immediately upon finding a key (skipping unnecessary housekeeping).\r\n    * Perform housekeeping only on cache misses to evict timed-out keys.\r\n    * Prioritize empty slots over eviction when inserting new keys.\r\n3. Update `create_announce_request` logic to support symmetric encryption via `create_announce_request_symmetric` and pass shared key arguments through the call stack (`do_friend`, `do_announce`, `populate_path_nodes`, `client_send_announce_request`).\r\n\r\n### 1. Disconnected Nodes (Major Improvement)\r\n\r\n*Optimizing the handling of timed-out or unreachable nodes yields the\r\nlargest gains.*\r\n\r\n| Benchmark Case | master (ns) | onion-opt-2 (ns) | Delta | Status |\r\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\r\n| **Disconnected/10** | 521,883 | 332,101 | **-36.36%** | 🚀 Huge Win |\r\n| **Disconnected/100** | 3,150,498 | 1,527,138 | **-51.53%** | 🚀 Huge Win |\r\n| **Disconnected/1000** | 22,779,786 | 12,365,778 | **-45.72%** | 🚀 Huge Win |\r\n| **Disconnected/2000** | 41,811,633 | 24,844,111 | **-40.58%** | 🚀 Huge Win |\r\n\r\n### 2. Connected Nodes & General Iteration\r\n\r\n*Standard operation shows consistent, measurable improvements.*\r\n\r\n| Benchmark Case | master (ns) | onion-opt-2 (ns) | Delta | Status |\r\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\r\n| **Connected/10** | 1,446 | 1,341 | **-7.26%** | ✅ Improved |\r\n| **Connected/20** | 2,470 | 2,327 | **-5.79%** | ✅ Improved |\r\n| **Iterate/200** | 2,330 | 2,237 | **-3.99%** | ✅ Improved |\r\n| **Iterate/300** | 3,233 | 3,193 | **-1.24%** | ✅ Improved |\r\n| **Iterate/0** | 243 | 239 | **-1.65%** | ✅ Improved |\r\n\r\n### 3. Neutral / Noise\r\n\r\n*Results within the margin of error.*\r\n\r\n| Benchmark Case | master (ns) | onion-opt-2 (ns) | Delta |\r\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\r\n| **Connected/0** | 239 | 239 | 0.00% |\r\n| **Disconnected/0** | 98,053 | 99,186 | +1.16% |\r\n| **Connected/50** | 5,541 | 5,602 | +1.10% |\r\n\r\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\r\n- - -\r\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/c-toxcore/2970)\r\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\r\n",
